      "text": "Cell-Based Architecture:\n  Earth divided into H3 hexagonal cells (~1km^2). Each city has dedicated cell services.\n  Gateway: geohash(pickup) -> cell_id -> route to SF-Downtown cell service.\n  Boundary: check adjacent cells when driver is within 500m of cell boundary.\n\nETA Service: Contraction Hierarchies graph (pre-computed shortcuts) gives O(log V) routing.\n  Base ETA + ML adjustment for time-of-day + weather + event surge.\n\nDynamic Pricing: surge = max(1.0, demand_requests_last_5min / active_drivers_in_cell)\n  surge > 2.0: alert rider; surge > 3.0: cap and notify ops.\n\nPayment: rider's card pre-authorized on match; charged on trip complete via Stripe.\nRating: POST /ratings {tripId, rating:5, comment:\"great ride\"} -> async update driver avg rating (Bayesian smoothing).\nKafka: every driver location update published to topic 'driver-locations'; analytics consumers compute heatmaps.",
      "originalText": "Cell-Based Architecture:\n  Earth divided into H3 hexagonal cells (~1km^2). Each city has dedicated cell services.\n  Gateway: geohash(pickup) -> cell_id -> route to SF-Downtown cell service.\n  Boundary: check adjacent cells when driver is within 500m of cell boundary.\n\nETA Service: Contraction Hierarchies graph (pre-computed shortcuts) gives O(log V) routing.\n  Base ETA + ML adjustment for time-of-day + weather + event surge.\n\nDynamic Pricing: surge = max(1.0, demand_requests_last_5min / active_drivers_in_cell)\n  surge > 2.0: alert rider; surge > 3.0: cap and notify ops.\n\nPayment: rider's card pre-authorized on match; charged on trip complete via Stripe.\nRating: POST /ratings {tripId, rating:5, comment:\"great ride\"} -> async update driver avg rating (Bayesian smoothing).\nKafka: every driver location update published to topic 'driver-locations'; analytics consumers compute heatmaps.",
